WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very exciting.
I -- I would -- Be honest.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.504
If I knew that I was gonna have
an author of a book

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.474
called "GingerNutz" on, I don´t
know if it would´ve been you.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why not?
-I don´t know.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:09.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
"GingerNutz"
does not strike me

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
as the name of
a book you´d write.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.646
How did you come to write a book
called "GingerNutz?"

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, well, I didn´t
actually write it.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
My friend Michael Roberts
wrote it.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.587
And conceived it, actually.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:24.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So why isn´t he here?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.760 size:78% position:39%
-Because you wouldn´t
have us on last week.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s true.
There you go.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
But how did this come about,
this book?

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was
a kind of silly story.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:37.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was...75 a while back.
-Yeah.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.808
And they were trying to throw me
a surprise birthday party.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
Do you like surprises?

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love surprises.
-Oh, good, okay.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.413
-Yeah, I do, fortunately.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, you know,
I always know

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
something´s hatching
when it´s my birthday time.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway...
Um, they decided they were --

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
they´d like a nice invitation
to send to everybody,

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.591
which I knew nothing about.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:02.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so they asked Michael,
who´s an illustrator --

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:03.930 size:81% position:41%
Well, he´s everything.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, anyway,
he´s an illustrator.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:10.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they asked him to do
an invitation for the party.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.740
-And this is the invitation
he drew -- for your 75th.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that is, uh...
There you go.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s wonderful.
-I think it´s wonderful.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, apparently,
everybody thought

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.683
I would be incredibly offended.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
Because it´s an orangutan

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
with very similar hair
to yours, yeah.

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:31.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-But anyway --

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.993
And I knew nothing about this,
and the whole invitation died,

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:37.330
and I think they just
e-mailed everybody or something.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t know.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway,
about three months later,

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
Michael suddenly
sent me this picture.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
E-mailed.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, actually,
I never look at e-mail,

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.576
but I did happen to see this.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said, you know,
"What the hell is this?"

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:56.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said, "You know,
it kind of looks like me."

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.085
And he told me the whole story.
-Okay.

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.887
And you were not offended?

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I absolutely love it.
I loved it.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:05.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, and I said, "She´s got to
go somewhere, this girl."

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.463 size:88% position:44%
-So, together we sort of
hatched up a sort of --

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so that´s how
we ended with --

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.335
"GingerNutz" ended up
with a very similar story to you

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:16.669
in a very similar memoir.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, actually --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was easy,
because Michael Roberts

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.711 size:88% position:44%
actually wrote my memoir
kind of with me, for me.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s fantastic.
-So he knew the story.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And he knew
how to take that story

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.450
and put it on an orangutan.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and sort of
parallel it with --

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s fantastic.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.822 size:84% position:42%
-´Cause the whole story
is completely my story.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:39.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You --
I first came to know you,

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know a lot of people
in the fashion world

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
have known you forever,
but "The September Issue,"

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.164 size:84% position:42%
which is an excellent
documentary about <i>Vogue</i>

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the inner workings
of <i>Vogue.</i>

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:47.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know,
not only do we see

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:48.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
sort of Anna Wintour at work,
but we --

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.470
I got to be introduced to you.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was that a film that you found
a lot of people

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
then became aware of
who you are?

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, yes, yeah.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t think anybody
knew who I was.

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, a few people
in the fashion business knew,

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:04.150
kind of knew me a little bit.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
But certainly
nobody in the street,

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.420
or I was never recognized.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And now, do people in the
streets approach you,

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
still from
"The September Issue?"

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, still, yes.

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:15.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are still seeing it.
It´s really incredible.

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:18.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s on planes or something.
I don´t know.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:21.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I remember watching it,
and for me,

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:24.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
it felt very similar to "SNL,"
in that it´s very --

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
the stress that goes into
putting together,

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.541
especially the September issue.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:31.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I felt
a real connection with you,

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:32.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I felt like
Lorne Michaels

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.846
is a lot like Anna Wintour,

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
and your role, I felt like,
was very similar

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.784
to a head writer at "SNL."

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:41.588
Because they sort of
are very good at giving bad news

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:44.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then having
<i>you </i>go tell it to people.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Uh-huh.

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:49.128
Yeah, like,
"Oh, those pictures are killed."

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:52.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but then,
it felt like you were very --

00:03:52.198 --> 00:03:54.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
you had the right personality
to do that,

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:56.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
to give people bad news.
Is that fair?

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
What gives you that --

00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I just mean,
you´re very sweet,

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.341
so I feel like you´d give to it
them in a way that´s easier.

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:02.875 size:81% position:41%
-Oh, I´m not so sweet.
-You´re not, really?

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:03.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:06.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´m really horrible.
-You know what?

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve mistaken you
with GingerNutz.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:08.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:12.051 size:88% position:44%
-The very kind orangutan
who gives you bad news.

